"gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov","html_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mekhovov/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":1910,"digest":"sha256:6c5406d865d59382e08877f7fbc3ccf2277e89746d8f9382a0b54d7b7a3b7e82","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-09-16T13:08:04Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T13:08:04Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/releases/download/v0.59.0/verification.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/tarball/v0.59.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/zipball/v0.59.0","body":"# v0.59.0 — Cross-mode navigation update\n\nThis package records the reviewed P03 native-navigation source scope below. Its actual qualification and original frozen payload evidence are attached. Affected player journeys and phase acceptance require separate public verification; this package does not claim completion of the music rollout, physical-device certification or later phases.\n\nReviewed P03 source scope: native navigation, couch reading, story focus.\n\nExact game source: `76dc4bf36baec11ce4dff6ca49773d3b9d6c0ae5` (tree `68a1ee7c6668464282703ac2b5aeb91231cf290f`).\n\nAll six source gates passed through the hosted exact-source workflow. Each of the two complete four-shard families passed 5,322 tests with zero failures, cancellations, skips or TODOs. Production reproduction/readiness and the ordinary build passed on the hosted source. Both hosted source families used Node 20.19.6. No local command gates are claimed by this qualification pipeline; earlier local P03 cohorts remain separately source-scoped corroboration. The full test suite and ordinary build use the actual hosted authority above; no duplicate local execution is claimed.\n\nThe separately authenticated hosted utility inspected the complete frozen original artifact. Its source archive matches all 7,927 tracked files and modes. Every one of the 675 game files matches its original manifest. Local assembly rehashes the retained original metadata and preserves exact runner member descriptors for the source and distribution payloads; it does not download or rehash the large originals locally. The attached evidence preserves the selected original qualification and navigation observations, including retained earlier failures; it does not replace verification of this release after deployment.\n\nPredecessor: [v0.58.1](https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/releases/tag/v0.58.1). Before normal main publication, preserve published predecessor v0.58.1 through a verified Archive18 route with honest admission scope, then complete the normal main publisher PR/merge, deployed byte verification and applicable native play/offline evidence. Source and attachment qualification alone do not establish public P03 acceptance.\n\nAt package assembly, public byte/play/offline verification is pending; acceptance is recorded separately after publication. P03 remains unaccepted. Modeled input, browser observations and physical-device qualification remain separate evidence categories.\n\nPlayer-facing changes include consistent Solo/Versus/Team entry, checked Stay/Replace decisions in More worlds, preserved paused flights, and keyboard remapping that accepts arrow keys without shared menu navigation intercepting them.\n\nKnown remaining P03 work includes an inherited Controller Practice iframe keyboard trap, remaining whole-screen navigation/recovery journeys, and physical touch/controller qualification. Its next correction is being tested separately. This release does not mark P03 complete.\n"}